id: full-awakening
name: Full Awakening
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/encounter
# Transformation Rules, Grand Awakening: "Each Super Awakening has their own Grand Trigger, a condition that must be met during this Combat
# Encounter before enabling a Grand Awakening. While that condition is met, that Character has access to the Full Awakening Maneuver" - open
# by its Grand Awakening's `allow` once its Grand Trigger is met. The page's entry has no Maneuver Type line: "Standard Maneuver" is mine,
# from its Action Cost of 1 Action.
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Unleashing your full might, you awaken the core of your being and light your fighting spirit ablaze.
text: >
  Full Awakening Maneuver [1/Encounter]: Unleashing your full might, you awaken the core of your being and light your fighting spirit ablaze.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Effect: Activate your Super Awakening’s Grand Awakening until the end of this Combat Encounter and regain Life and Ki Points equal to 1/4 (rounded up) of their respective maximums.

---

# The Grand Awakening active till the Encounter ends, a quarter of each Maximum back, rounded up (transformations.mjs fullAwakening), then
# the full-awakening Moment.
[on used]
fullAwakening();
